<node id="RAG-Anything">
  <data key="d0">RAG-Anything</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">RAG-Anything is a comprehensive framework for Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) that excels in multimodal knowledge unification and long-context document understanding. It is designed to address the limitations of existing text-centric systems by extending GraphRAG to all modalities, including visual elements, structured data, and mathematical expressions. RAG-Anything employs a dual-graph construction strategy, enhancing its performance on long documents through cross-modal hybrid retrieval. This framework demonstrates advanced visual reasoning and complex tabular data handling capabilities, making it a robust system for multimodal document understanding.

RAG-Anything is an all-in-one RAG framework that outperforms other methods in accuracy across various domains, particularly in information-dense contexts. It is noted for its superior performance on long documents compared to MM-GraphRAG and is used in case studies to answer questions about visual documents and financial table navigation. The system is designed to handle complex visual reasoning tasks and is used in the analysis and evaluation of multimodal document understanding. RAG-Anything is an advanced retrieval and augmentation framework that constructs modality-aware graphs to manage complex document layouts, and it has demonstrated systematic factual accuracy in various tasks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f5f0a5a74b5a4eac43772c74649ca651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eac0008c777dab7291aec281277e77a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d4727f37ea1b30518f13dc89ffc7ea1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de93d4b6f02e5ae737b9b9e8142401cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a43d425aea6f4b6c0edc38f28595f400&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7aefd567d430c404aab77872282400eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dded67fd8182de2201aa35ccbb4c8cd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6489e2fb8e8849e9fba34fe5f95e4a0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3199f24e41812cb62bea94f7c85f2636&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63a71b30187cb0788470f7a4ef8b5a7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfc6c28e224a59948d1c3f970cd333d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3030640e3aa96c21a21f63f845339bb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-841b2e1a62bf11ef382f155dc5fd836b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1025c419093621f01b9bd6bda58a4d8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0b7a22ef18d1df90b09c6752fdaa849&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d7b65a77beeebaa7ba6c82a6b282bc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-514397fe4b91c504d493b81ae4f2af0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc6b663130fa82a15ae0568ebdd7e714&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e67b53472cda54f4238a2ccf98da3bdd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26f9e861c68e93709074930b8e53d41c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55d457152e0dea0c28144e5e94403cb2</data>
