<node id="MM-GraphRAG">
  <data key="d0">MM-GraphRAG</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">MM-GraphRAG is a model that exhibits comparable performance to RAG-Anything on shorter documents.&lt;SEP&gt;MM-GraphRAG is a framework that is compared with RAG-Anything in the performance evaluation.&lt;SEP&gt;MM-GraphRAG is a system used for comparison with RAG-Anything in performance evaluations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-de93d4b6f02e5ae737b9b9e8142401cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0b7a22ef18d1df90b09c6752fdaa849&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55d457152e0dea0c28144e5e94403cb2</data>
