</node>
<node id="Chunk-only">
  <data key="d0">Chunk-only</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Chunk-only is a variant of RAG-Anything that bypasses graph construction and relies solely on traditional chunk-based retrieval.&lt;SEP&gt;Chunk-only is a method that bypasses dual-graph construction and relies solely on traditional chunk-based retrieval.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-de93d4b6f02e5ae737b9b9e8142401cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c1dc026d368316a0e447d9d04cb5bc4</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791643554</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="w/o Reranker">
  <data key="d0">w/o Reranker</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">w/o Reranker is a variant of RAG-Anything that eliminates the cross-modal reranking component.&lt;SEP&gt;w/o Reranker is a method that retains the core graph-based architecture but removes the cross-modal reranking component.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-de93d4b6f02e5ae737b9b9e8142401cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c1dc026d368316a0e447d9d04cb5bc4</data>
