</node>
<node id="Graph Construction">
  <data key="d0">Graph Construction</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Graph Construction refers to the process of creating a graph-based retrieval mechanism in RAG-Anything.&lt;SEP&gt;Graph Construction is the process where the function constructs the graph by associating the extracted entities and relationships into a structured format.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-de93d4b6f02e5ae737b9b9e8142401cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abcce11b032cb7a3594b3a1302046124</data>
