  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Dual-graph Construction is a key architectural component in RAG-Anything that involves creating a graph-based retrieval mechanism.&lt;SEP&gt;Dual-graph Construction is a mechanism used in RAG-ANYTHING for long-document reasoning tasks.</data>
