  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">RAG is a paradigm for dynamically expanding the knowledge boundaries of LLMs by retrieving and incorporating external knowledge sources.&lt;SEP&gt;RAG is a paradigm that enables dynamic retrieval and incorporation of external knowledge during inference.</data>
