  <data key="d5">1791643559</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Retrieval Bias Toward Text">
  <data key="d0">Retrieval Bias Toward Text</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Retrieval Bias Toward Text is a specific issue in multimodal RAG systems where they demonstrate a bias toward textual passages.&lt;SEP&gt;Retrieval Bias Toward Text is a specific issue where current RAG systems favor textual passages over visual content.&lt;SEP&gt;Retrieval Bias Toward Text is a systemic issue where current RAG systems demonstrate a pronounced bias toward textual passages, especially when visual content lacks exact keyword matches.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7aefd567d430c404aab77872282400eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e67b53472cda54f4238a2ccf98da3bdd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26f9e861c68e93709074930b8e53d41c</data>
