  <data key="d0">Rigid Spatial Processing Patterns</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Rigid Spatial Processing Patterns is a specific issue in multimodal RAG systems where they exhibit fundamental rigidity in spatial interpretation.</data>
