  <data key="d0">LLM</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">LLM stands for Large Language Model, which is a static repository of knowledge.&lt;SEP&gt;LLM is a language model that generates responses based on the Hybrid Retrieved Info.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dded67fd8182de2201aa35ccbb4c8cd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1025c419093621f01b9bd6bda58a4d8b</data>
