<node id="detailed_description">
  <data key="d0">detailed_description</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">detailed_description is a key in the structured prompt template that contains guidelines for describing the overall composition and layout.&lt;SEP&gt;detailed_description is a field in the JSON schema that requires a comprehensive analysis of the equation's mathematical meaning, variable definitions, operations, application domain, physical significance, relationships to other concepts, practical applications, and connection to the broader framework.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2d13b5eb03f64e659615c9a7b0a7b167&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7f162fe747d4504218a5bc094c97cc4</data>
