<edge source="Graph-Enhanced Retrieval-Augmented Generation" target="GraphRAG">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Graph-Enhanced Retrieval-Augmented Generation is implemented through the GraphRAG approach, which optimizes structures for retrieval efficiency.</data>
  <data key="d9">implementation,method</data>
