<edge source="LightRAG" target="RAG-Anything">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">RAG-Anything outperforms LightRAG in treating text, images, tables, and equations as first-class entities.&lt;SEP&gt;RAG-Anything integrates with LightRAG, a sparsified index approach within the GraphRAG framework.&lt;SEP&gt;RAG-Anything outperforms LightRAG, which is text-only.&lt;SEP&gt;RAG-Anything outperforms LightRAG in the financial table navigation case study.&lt;SEP&gt;RAG-Anything outperforms LightRAG, which provides incorrect answers.</data>
