<edge source="MMGraphRAG" target="RAG-Anything">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">RAG-Anything outperforms MMGraphRAG in long-context document comprehension and cross-domain generalization.&lt;SEP&gt;MMGraphRAG fails to handle complex layouts and repeated terminology due to lack of structural understanding.&lt;SEP&gt;RAG-Anything integrates with MMGraphRAG, which links scene graphs with textual representations.&lt;SEP&gt;MMGraphRAG is a data series in the line chart representing the performance of MM-GraphRAG.&lt;SEP&gt;RAG-Anything outperforms MMGraphRAG, which treats tables and equations as plain text.&lt;SEP&gt;RAG-Anything outperforms MMGraphRAG in the financial table navigation case study.&lt;SEP&gt;RAG-Anything outperforms MMGraphRAG, which provides incorrect answers.</data>
  <data key="d9">data series,framework comparison,framework type,incorrect answer,integration,method,model comparison,performance,performance comparison,performance metric,related work,system comparison</data>
