<edge source="RAG-Anything" target="DocBench">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">RAG-Anything is evaluated on DocBench to validate its performance.&lt;SEP&gt;RAG-Anything shows significant performance improvements on long documents compared to other models on DocBench.&lt;SEP&gt;RAG-Anything is evaluated on DocBench for varying document lengths.&lt;SEP&gt;RAG-Anything shows a significant performance advantage over MM-GraphRAG on documents exceeding 100 pages on DocBench.&lt;SEP&gt;RAG-Anything is designed to handle documents from the DocBench benchmark.</data>
  <data key="d9">benchmark coverage,document length,document type,document understanding,evaluation,long documents,performance comparison,performance evaluation,performance validation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-de93d4b6f02e5ae737b9b9e8142401cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dded67fd8182de2201aa35ccbb4c8cd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3199f24e41812cb62bea94f7c85f2636&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0b7a22ef18d1df90b09c6752fdaa849&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc6b663130fa82a15ae0568ebdd7e714</data>
  <data key="d11">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791643565</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="RAG-Anything" target="MMLongBench">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">RAG-Anything is evaluated on MMLongBench to validate its performance.&lt;SEP&gt;RAG-Anything demonstrates consistent improvements across all length categories on MMLongBench.&lt;SEP&gt;RAG-Anything outperforms other methods in accuracy across various domains on the MMLongBench dataset.&lt;SEP&gt;RAG-Anything is evaluated on MMLongBench for long-context documents.&lt;SEP&gt;RAG-Anything demonstrates consistent improvements across all length categories on MMLongBench.&lt;SEP&gt;RAG-Anything is designed to handle documents from the MMLongBench benchmark.</data>
  <data key="d9">benchmark coverage,document length,document type,document understanding,evaluation,long documents,method evaluation,performance comparison,performance evaluation,performance validation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-de93d4b6f02e5ae737b9b9e8142401cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dded67fd8182de2201aa35ccbb4c8cd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3199f24e41812cb62bea94f7c85f2636&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfc6c28e224a59948d1c3f970cd333d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0b7a22ef18d1df90b09c6752fdaa849&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc6b663130fa82a15ae0568ebdd7e714</data>
